{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass at that time.</b> Why is this passage juxtaposed here, and it interrupted the passage of Joseph? To teach that his brothers demoted him from his greatness when they saw their father's distress — they said: You said to sell him; had you said to return him, we would have listened to you." "<b>And turned.</b> From his brothers." "<b>Unto a certain Adullamite.</b> He partnered with him."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:33.667681758Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}